# W1-D2 keeps everything. Nothing here is ignored.
#
#   runs/L*/work_definition.json   the agent artifact, where one is produced
#   runs/L*/acp_transcript.jsonl   append-only ACP transcript + lifecycle records
#   runs/L*/harness_result.json    outcome, reason, per-turn log, pre-run snapshot
#   RESULTS.md / RESULTS.json      the STRUCTURAL grader's record   (primary)
#   FIDELITY.md / FIDELITY.json    the FIDELITY gate's record       (primary)
#   A4_SHADOW.md / A4_SHADOW.json  descriptive shadow audit         (NOT a verdict)
